BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:earliest-db-ice-cologne-20261014@schengentrip2026
DTSTAMP:20260930T133000Z
DTSTART:20261014T060000
DTEND:20261014T070000
SUMMARY:🚆 Book DB ICE 123: Amsterdam ➔ Cologne (Super Sparpreis Nationwide Release!)
DESCRIPTION:Trip Day 5 (19 Dec 2026): Deutsche Bahn Winter Timetable Sales Drop!\n\nNationwide ticket sales for the new winter timetable launch today at 06:00 AM PST (09:00 AM CET). Book DB ICE 123 (08:38 Amsterdam Centraal ➔ 11:15 Köln Hbf) immediately to grab the limited quota of €19.90 – €29.90 Super Sparpreis Europa tickets.\n\nAdd €5.50 seat reservation to guarantee you sit together with luggage space during the Christmas market rush.\n\nBooking Link: https://int.bahn.de or DB Navigator App
URL:https://int.bahn.de
STATUS:CONFIRMED
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT15M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Reminder: Book DB ICE 123 on int.bahn.de (Super Sparpreis Nationwide Drop!)
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT

